        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Ives 7222xHSP28 Offset Door Pivot Set</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 3/4\" offset pivots are engineered for durability on doors weighing up to 200 pounds. Set includes top pivot and bottom pivot with installation hardware.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe bottom pivot is mortised into the threshold and the doors bottom. Top pivot is mortised into the header and top of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for 7222 Offset Door Pivot Set\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Offset: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 200 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Sprayed Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><b>Handed - Must specify left hand door or right hand door when ordering</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this pivot hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
